{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus\/notSupported","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:6EidKit17PassiveAuthStatusO12notSupportedyA2CmF","title":"PassiveAuthStatus.notSupported","modules":[{"name":"EidKit"}],"roleHeading":"Case","symbolKind":"case","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"notSupported"}]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Passive auth could not be performed because the card’s ICAO data group files (SOD\/DG2\/DG7)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not accessible in the current session context."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus\/notsupported"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"notSupported"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"On iOS, this occurs because the system NFC stack always pre-selects the national AID1","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"applet before the SDK receives the tag. The card’s security policy blocks cross-applet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"access to the ICAO applet from within an AID1 secure messaging session.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is a platform constraint, not an SDK error. Passive auth works normally on Android.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","role":"collection","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/eidkit","title":"EidKit"},"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit/PassiveAuthStatus/notSupported":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notSupported","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"PassiveAuthStatus.notSupported","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Passive auth could not be performed because the card’s ICAO data group files (SOD\/DG2\/DG7)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not accessible in the current session context."}],"url":"\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus\/notsupported","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus\/notSupported"},"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit/PassiveAuthStatus":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Result of passive authentication — verifies that the data on the card was signed by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Romanian state (MAI) and has not been tampered with."}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PassiveAuthStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"PassiveAuthStatus","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PassiveAuthStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus"}}}